      "id": "row-drafting",
      "x": -320,
      "y": 1520,
      "w": 240,
      "text": "DRAFTING \u00b7 THREE DIRECTIONS\n\nA is what ships today.\nB leads with the sentence.\nC makes the sheet the interface.\n\nPick one, or mix."
    },
